<title>USA: Culbro mulling options to raise capital.</title>
<headline>Culbro mulling options to raise capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Culbro Corp said on Friday that it is considering a secondary offering of Culbro stock or an initial public stock offering of its General Cigar unit in an effort to raise new equity capital.</p>
<p>The new capital would be earmarked for expansion and aquisitions, Culbro said.</p>
<p>The company added that it intends to spin off its non-cigar businesses and other non-cigar assets into a new publically traded company.</p>
<p>Culbro said it intends to determine its course of action in the next few months, with implementation seen completed in the first half on 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
